      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions: <Subject 1> is the woman in the supplied <Picture 1>, with long black hair and white-and-purple armor with glowing violet details.\n\nsummary: [reference generation] A five-second video of <Subject 1> dancing on a peaceful beach.\n\nretention_analysis: <Subject 1>: fully_preserved - Keep her face, hair, and original armor. Place her on a beach.\n\ndetailed_description: [Shot 1] Photorealistic. <Subject 1> dances gently on a quiet beach at golden hour. She sways her torso and makes graceful arm gestures, ending with a soft smile. Her hair flows in the sea breeze, and the armor plates retain their shape. Warm sunlight, soft ocean waves, pale sand, and a clear sky.\n\noverall_soundscape: Gentle ocean waves and a soft sea breeze.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Light piano and fingerpicked acoustic guitar at 85 BPM, with delicate percussion and a gentle ending.",
